{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19924","headline":"懊恼 · 孟郊","name":"懊恼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恶诗皆得官，好诗空抱山。\n抱山冷殑殑，终日悲颜颜。\n好诗更相嫉，劒戟生牙关。\n前贤死已久，犹在咀嚼间。\n以我残杪身，清峭养高闲。\n求闲未得闲，衆诮瞋虤虤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}